[00:30.32]People lived in the rock-house for hundreds of years, but from about 1962, no one lived there and the house stayed empty.
[00:41.22]Angelo liked the rock-house very much.
[00:44.84]He looked into the possibility of buying it.
[00:47.84]It was for sale and in 2010 he decided to get it.
[00:53.58]After that, he started to cut into the rock and to rebuild and modernise the house.
[01:01.18]Angelo (who is English, even though his name is Italian) finished the house in nine months.
[01:09.34]He was a businessman before he started the house, and before 2007 he was quite ill, so he wanted a place where it was possible for him to live in a happy and healthy way.
